        "text": "The case involves interpretation of the phrase \u201cnow under Federal jurisdiction\u201d in the Indian Reorganization Act of 1934, with the parties and the Court questioning whether \u201cnow\u201d refers to the time of enactment or to the present day."
      }
    ],
